00:10:05.371 --> 00:10:06.497
Mmm.


00:11:22.481 --> 00:11:25.177
Me too. It was very, very powerful.


00:11:25.251 --> 00:11:28.345
Yes, me too. Very powerful.


00:11:28.421 --> 00:11:31.720
